    <data key="d0">Careem Fraud Detection System (CrazyWall)</data>
    <data key="d1" />
    <data key="d2">System uses historical data batch processing via S3 and EMR into Neptune, alongside real-time event processing through SQS, Elastic Beanstalk, and Neptune.</data>
